{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297913","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297913","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1029791301:1":{"text":"这里的人可真多啊……芙拉贝尔，跟好我，别走丢了。","source_cn":"这里的人可真多啊……芙拉贝尔，跟好我，别走丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2AD1C842BDB9E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791302:1":{"text":"放心吧，我又不是班上的那些小孩子。","source_cn":"放心吧，我又不是班上的那些小孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD59829931E85525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791303:1":{"text":"光是比力气，莱卡可不一定能赢得过我哦？","source_cn":"光是比力气，莱卡可不一定能赢得过我哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98602510209C26F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791304:1":{"text":"那不用比了，我甘拜下风。","source_cn":"那不用比了，我甘拜下风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE826E994A53870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791305:1":{"text":"谁能和你这种单手就制服三个乱跑的小孩子的家伙比啊。","source_cn":"谁能和你这种单手就制服三个乱跑的小孩子的家伙比啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61713CD19BA1D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791306:1":{"text":"呵呵呵，我就当你是在羡慕我好了。","source_cn":"呵呵呵，我就当你是在羡慕我好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D11CEAB7C76BAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791307:1":{"text":"说起来，难得的假期，我们好好逛逛，多买些特产带回去当礼物吧？","source_cn":"说起来，难得的假期，我们好好逛逛，多买些特产带回去当礼物吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D4EBB1F1080065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791308:1":{"text":"嗯，我已经列好清单了！","source_cn":"嗯，我已经列好清单了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C8229D88410BEC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"莱卡","source":"莱卡","status":"source"},"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"芙拉贝尔","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}